// Dialog :
"P1672545710" "Taking out that research facility will definitely strike their plans a grievous blow, and those people you rescued will be thanking you for the rest of their lives. I'll get our people working on the information you found at the lab. The shipping record for those N-fragments could lead us to another facility. The fragments themselves, we're going to turn over to SERAPH. They'll be eager to study them."
// RandomFameString :
"P4223038411" "I heard that {HeroName} really messed up some big Council research project."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Kheldian_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1514169023" "Your recent successes have forced the Council's hand. They have begun to clean out any bases or labs attached to their Nictus work that remain in the City, and are moving the assets from them off-shore. This gives us a great opportunity, but little time to work on it. Fortunately, some Trolls captured in a raid by other heroes revealed that the Council is moving some equipment through their tunnels. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>This is the perfect chance to capture the Council's research, and I thought you might like to spearhead the operation.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3555923652" "Capture Council research in Troll Tunnels"
// SendOffString :
"P856811704" "While the main point of this operation is to capture more Council research data before they can take it off-shore, you will also have to make sure that no enemies escape capture so that they cannot warn their allies that we know their plans. You will have to be thorough, but I know you can handle it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P456519935" "Defeat all foes in tunnels"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1250731923" "Remember that along with capturing the Council's research and defeating all of them to keep it quiet, there may still be captives held somewhere in the city. Any information you find could help free them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3560749466" "The natural beauty of these caverns has been trampled by the current villainous inhabitants."

