// Dialog :
"P3446142620" "The information you recovered will be invaluable. This was probably our last chance to capture the Council's data before they got it off-shore, and you really came through. SERAPH will be pouring through this for months. There may still be one last operation left to wrap this up. Talk to me soon."
// RandomFameString :
"P845541716" "I hear {HeroName} just captured a whole bunch of the Council's research before they could move it off-shore."

