// Task - SL3_Kheldian_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1016190794" "It seems that there's one last element of the Council's Nictus experimentation that they haven't yet gotten off-shore. The Council has not yet been able to smuggle out the last captives it used for human experimentation. If it weren't for the documents you found, we never would have found out about it before it was too late. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now those people may have a chance, if you are willing to rescue them from the Council.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2562040013" "Rescue the final group of the Council's captive human test subjects"
// SendOffString :
"P878871320" "These people are in desperate danger, {HeroName}. If the Council thinks that they cannot smuggle them out, they will probably terminate them to keep them quiet. You could be their last chance at freedom. And in order to keep their identities safe afterwards, you must also defeat the base's commander, and make certain that their records are destroyed."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1674388491" "Defeat Archon Douglas & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4088400436" "Those people need your help, {HeroName}. You are their last chance for freedom."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P630363487" "This sprawling Council controlled complex houses the last of the captive human test subjects left on the mainland."

